nb, 'saved', 0, 'logTag', '', 'splitMap', '{}'::jsonb, 'follow', null,\n        'rows', (select coalesce(jsonb_agg(to_jsonb(b) - 'synced_at' order by b.sheet_row, b.id), '[]'::jsonb) from bom_rows b where upper(b.product) = P),\n        'log', (select coalesce(jsonb_agg(to_jsonb(l) - 'synced_at' order by l.sheet_row desc), '[]'::jsonb) from (select * from bom_log where upper(product) = P order by sheet_row desc limit 50) l));\n    end if;\n    raise exception '품목코드 % 는 그사이 BOM이 생겼습니다(다른 사람이 같은 코드를 먼저 저장). [만들기]를 다시 눌러 새 코드를 받아 주세요.', P;\n  end if;\n  for x in select y from jsonb_array_elements(prow) y loop\n    if rb_t(x->'id') = '' or rb_t(x->'id') ~ '^R\\d' then raise exception 'RB_FALLBACK 줄ID 없는 줄(% 행)', x->>'sheet_row'; end if;\n    if bysr ? (x->>'sheet_row') then raise exception 'RB_FALLBACK 행 번호 겹침 %', x->>'sheet_row'; end if;\n    O := O || jsonb_build_object(x->>'id', x);\n    bysr := bysr || jsonb_build_object(x->>'sheet_row', x->>'id');\n    lastRow := (x->>'sheet_row')::int; tmplId := x->>'id';\n    if upper(rb_t(x->'code')) = P or rb_t(x->'type') = '제품' then prodName := coalesce(nullif(prodName, ''), rb_t(x->'name')); end if;\n  end loop;\n  brand := rb_t(prow->0->'brand');\n  -- 수식(sheet_rows '_bomfml:줄ID'). 모르는 줄이 있거나 범위 수식(맨 아래 붙이기가 안 되는 품목 — bomAppendSafe_)이면 서버 길\n  for x in select y from jsonb_array_elements(prow) y loop\n    select cells into fm from sheet_rows where tab = '_bomfml:' || (x->>'id') and \"row\" = 0;\n    if fm is null then raise exception 'RB_FALLBACK 수식 모름(% 행)', x->>'sheet_row'; end if;\n    for fk in select jsonb_object_keys(fm) loop\n      if rb_t(fm->fk) = '' then fm := fm - fk; continue; end if;\n      if rb_t(fm->fk) ~ ':' then raise exception 'RB_FALLBACK 범위 수식이 있는 품목(% 행)', x->>'sheet_row'; end if;\n    end loop;\n    OF := OF || jsonb_build_object(x->>'id', fm);\n  end loop;\n\n  if isNew then\n    if exists (select 1 from bom_rows b where upper(b.code) = P) then raise exception '품목코드 % 는 이미 다른 품목 BOM에 자재로 쓰이고 있습니다. 코드를 다시 확인해 주세요.', P; end if;\n    if exists (select 1 from jsonb_array_elements(chg) y where y->>'kind' is distinct from 'add') then raise exception '신제품 BOM은 자재 추가로만 만들 수 있습니다.'; end if;\n    brand := rb_t(meta->'newProduct'->'brand'); prodName := rb_t(meta->'newProduct'->'name');\n    if jsonb_typeof(meta->'newProduct'->'extra') = 'array' then\n      select coalesce(array_agg(t order by nn), '{}') into extra from (select upper(rb_t(z)) as t, nn from jsonb_array_elements(meta->'newProduct'->'extra') with ordinality q(z, nn)) w\n        where t ~ '^[A-Z]{1,2}\\d{4}[A-Z]{2}\\d+$' and t <> P;\n    end if;\n    foreach ec in array extra loop\n      if exists (select 1 from bom_rows b where upper(b.product) = ec or upper(b.code) = ec) then raise exception '국가별 코드 % 는 그사이 BOM에 쓰였습니다. [만들기]를 다시 눌러 주세요.', ec; end if;\n    end loop;\n    -- 새 줄은 BOM 탭 맨 아래 줄을 본뜬다(값 · 수식)\n    select to_jsonb(b) into tmplRec from bom_rows b order by b.sheet_row desc, b.id desc limit 1;\n    if tmplRec is null or rb_t(tmplRec->'id') = '' or rb_t(tmplRec->'id') ~ '^R\\d' then raise exception 'RB_FALLBACK 맨 아래 줄 모름'; end if;\n    select cells into tmplF from sheet_rows where tab = '_bomfml:' || (tmplRec->>'id') and \"row\" = 0;\n    if tmplF is null then raise exception 'RB_FALLBACK 수식 모름(맨 아래 줄)'; end if;\n    tmplF := (select coalesce(jsonb_object_agg(key, value), '{}'::jsonb) from jsonb_each(tmplF) where rb_t(value) <> '');\n    tmplId := tmplRec->>'id'; lastRow := (tmplRec->>'sheet_row')::int;\n  end if;\n  -- ── 줄 다시 찾기(bomReRow_) · 끝 차수 확인 ──\n  for i in 0 .. jsonb_array_length(chg) - 1 loop\n    c := chg->i;\n    if c->>'kind' = 'add' then continue; end if;\n    rr := case when rb_t(c->'row') ~ '^\\d+$' then rb_t(c->'row')::int else null end;\n    rid := bysr->>(rr::text);\n    same_ids := '{}'; byid := '{}';\n    for x in select y from jsonb_array_elements(prow) y loop\n      if upper(rb_t(x->'code')) = upper(rb_t(c->'code')) and rb_t(x->'start_round') = rb_t(c->'start') and (not (c ? 'end') or rb_t(x->'end_round') = rb_t(c->'end')) then\n        same_ids := same_ids || (x->>'id');\n        if rb_t(c->'id') <> '' and rb_t(x->'id') = rb_t(c->'id') then byid := byid || (x->>'id'); end if;\n      end if;\n    end loop;\n    if rid is not null and rid = any(same_ids) and not (rb_t(c->'id') <> '' and rb_t(O->rid->'id') <> rb_t(c->'id')) then null;\n    elsif coalesce(array_length(byid, 1), 0) = 1 then rid := byid[1];\n    elsif coalesce(array_length(same_ids, 1), 0) = 1 then rid := same_ids[1];\n    else raise exception 'BOM 시트가 그사이 바뀌었습니다(%). BOM 보기를 다시 열어 주세요.', case when c ? 'code' and jsonb_typeof(c->'code') <> 'null' then rb_t(c->'code') else 'undefined' end;\n    end if;\n    chg := jsonb_set(chg, array[i::text], c || jsonb_build_object('_id', rid, 'row', (O->rid->>'sheet_row')::int));\n  end loop;\n  if (select count(*) <> count(distinct y->>'_id') from jsonb_array_elements(chg) y where y->>'kind' is distinct from 'add') then raise exception 'RB_FALLBACK 같은 줄을 두 번 고침'; end if;\n  -- 품목명만 고친 줄: 품목 DB · 같은 코드 다른 BOM 줄 이름 맞추기(bomRenamesFrom_ · bomRenameApply_) → 서버 길\n  for c in select y from jsonb_array_elements(chg) y loop\n    if c->>'kind' = 'add' or rb_bom_truthy(c->'remove') then continue; end if;\n    if jsonb_typeof(coalesce(c->'vendor', 'null')) = 'null' and jsonb_typeof(coalesce(c->'spec', 'null')) = 'null' and jsonb_typeof(coalesce(c->'qty', 'null')) = 'null'\n       and jsonb_typeof(coalesce(c->'name', 'null')) <> 'null' and rb_t(c->'name') <> '' and rb_t(c->'name') <> rb_t(O->(c->>'_id')->'name') then\n      raise exception 'RB_FALLBACK 품목명 고침(품목 DB · 다른 BOM 이름 맞추기)';\n    end if;\n  end loop;\n\n  -- ── 원가 겹침(bomCkClash_) ──\n  for c in select y from jsonb_array_elements(chg) y loop\n    if c->>'kind' = 'add' then\n      rgS := case when c ? 's' and jsonb_typeof(c->'s') <> 'null' and rb_t(c->'s') <> '' then rb_bom_rint(c->'s') else N end;\n      rgE := case when c ? 'e' and jsonb_typeof(c->'e') <> 'null' and rb_t(c->'e') <> '' then rb_bom_rint(c->'e') else 0 end;\n      if not (rgS between 1 and 999) then raise exception '추가 줄 시작 차수가 올바르지 않습니다: %', rb_t(c->'s'); end if;\n      if rgE <> 0 and not (rgE >= rgS and rgE <= 999) then raise exception '추가 줄 끝 차수는 시작 차수(%차)보다 앞일 수 없습니다.', rgS; end if;\n      if c->'ck' is distinct from 'false'::jsonb then\n        ckC := ckC || jsonb_build_array(jsonb_build_object('r', 0, 'type', rb_t(c->'type'), 'semi', '', 'code', case when rb_bom_truthy(c->'reuse') then rb_t(c->'want') else '' end, 'name', rb_t(c->'name'), 'vendor', rb_t(c->'vendor'), 's', rgS, 'e', case when rgE = 0 then 99999 else rgE end));\n      end if;\n      continue;\n    end if;\n    x := O->(c->>'_id');\n    if rb_bom_truthy(c->'remove') or c->'ck' = 'false'::jsonb then ckOff := ckOff || jsonb_build_object(x->>'sheet_row', 1); continue; end if;\n    if c->'ck' = 'true'::jsonb then\n      eX := rb_bom_rnum(rb_t(x->'end_round'));\n      ckC := ckC || jsonb_build_array(jsonb_build_object('r', (x->>'sheet_row')::int, 'type', rb_t(x->'type'), 'semi', rb_t(x->'semi'), 'code', rb_t(x->'code'),\n        'name', case when jsonb_typeof(coalesce(c->'name', 'null')) <> 'null' then rb_t(c->'name') else rb_t(x->'name') end,\n        'vendor', case when jsonb_typeof(coalesce(c->'vendor', 'null')) <> 'null' then rb_t(c->'vendor') else rb_t(x->'vendor') end,\n        's', N, 'e', case when eX is not null and eX <> 0 and eX >= N then eX else 99999 end));\n    end if;\n  end loop;\n  if jsonb_array_length(ckC) > 0 and not isNew then perform rb_bom_clash(prow, ckC, ckOff); end if;\n\n  -- ── 차례: 추가(넣은 순서) → 고친 줄(아래 줄부터). 맨 아래 붙이기(APP) ──\n  -- 신제품은 서버가 마지막 줄 아래에 거꾸로 끼워 넣는다(차례 = 넣은 순서의 거꾸로 · 시트 순서는 넣은 순서) — 새 코드 · 줄ID 가 거꾸로 매겨짐\n  select coalesce(jsonb_agg(y order by case when isNew then -ordn else ordn end), '[]'::jsonb) into adds from jsonb_array_elements(chg) with ordinality q(y, ordn) where y->>'kind' = 'add';\n  select coalesce(jsonb_agg(y order by (y->>'row')::int desc, ordn), '[]'::jsonb) into edits from jsonb_array_elements(chg) with ordinality q(y, ordn) where y->>'kind' is distinct from 'add';\n  ordered := adds || edits;\n  select coalesce(max(sheet_row), 2) into maxSr from bom_rows;\n  select coalesce(max(substring(id from '^B(\\d+)$')::bigint), 0) into maxB from bom_rows;\n  W := (select coalesce(jsonb_object_agg(key, jsonb_build_object('r', value, 'f', OF->key)), '{}'::jsonb) from jsonb_each(O));\n  if isNew then W := W || jsonb_build_object(tmplId, jsonb_build_object('r', tmplRec, 'f', tmplF)); end if;\n  if rb_t(meta->'orderId') <> '' then orderRef := btrim(rb_t(meta->'doc') || ' ' || rb_t(meta->'name')) || ' [' || rb_t(meta->'orderId') || ']'; end if;\n\n  for c in select y from jsonb_array_elements(ordered) y loop\n    why := left(rb_t(c->'why'), 200);\n    if c->>'kind' = 'add' then\n      -- ── 자재 추가 ──\n      if conf->'types' is null then raise exception 'RB_FALLBACK 구분 약호 표 모름'; end if;\n      if conf->'hf' is null then raise exception 'RB_FALLBACK 핸들링피 설정 모름'; end if;\n      -- 제조사(hfMakerOf_) 핸들링피가 있으면 새 줄 배송비 수식(hfApplyRows_) — 서버 길\n      select v2 into wv from (\n        select rb_t(y->'vendor') as v2, (rb_t(y->'end_round') = '') as op_, coalesce(rb_bom_rnum(rb_t(y->'start_round')), 0) as s_, ordn\n        from jsonb_array_elements(prow) with ordinality q(y, ordn) where rb_code_key(rb_t(y->'code')) = P) z\n        order by op_ desc, s_ desc, ordn desc limit 1;\n      tcode := coalesce(conf->'types'->>rb_t(c->'type'), 'MS');\n      wv := rb_code_key(rb_t(c->'want'));\n      -- m051: 제품 · 세트 줄(세트 구성 완제품이면 그 코드) · 반제품 BOM 머리 줄(코드 = 이 품목) · 반제품(브랜드 + X + 번호 + 국가)\n      isProd := rb_t(c->'type') in ('제품', '세트'); compCode := case when isProd then wv else '' end; isComp := false;\n      if compCode <> '' and compCode <> P then\n        if compCode !~ '^[A-Z]\\d{4}[A-Z]{2}\\d+$' then raise exception '세트 구성 완제품 코드 형식이 아닙니다: % (예: H0007AA1)', compCode; end if;\n        ncode := compCode; ver := 1; tcode := ''; isComp := true;\n      elsif isProd or wv = P then\n        ncode := P; ver := 1; tcode := '';\n        if U is null then U := rb_bom_used(conf); end if;\n        U := U || jsonb_build_object(P, 1);\n      elsif rb_bom_truthy(c->'reuse') and wv <> '' then          -- 기존 자재 그대로 쓰기(공용): 그 코드 · 새 코드 검사 없음\n        ncode := wv; ver := coalesce(substring(wv from '(\\d+)$')::numeric, 1);\n      elsif wv <> '' then\n        -- bomWantCode_\n        if wv !~ '^[A-Z]{1,2}\\d{4}[A-Z]{2}\\d+$' then raise exception '새 코드 형식이 아닙니다: % (예: MP0178TB2)', wv; end if;\n        if seenW ? wv then raise exception '% 를 이번 저장에서 두 줄에 적었습니다. 다른 번호로 해 주세요.', wv; end if;\n        select case when bool_or(rb_t(cells->11) !~ '미사용') then 'db' when count(*) > 0 then 'unused' else '' end into st\n          from sheet_rows where tab = '_실행판_품목' and \"row\" > 1 and rb_code_key(rb_t(cells->0)) = wv;\n        if st = 'db' then raise exception '% 는 품목 DB 에 이미 있는 코드입니다 — 그 자재를 쓰려면 코드 칸 [🔍 기존 코드 찾기]로 고르세요.', wv; end if;\n        if exists (select 1 from bom_rows where upper(bom_rows.product) = wv or upper(bom_rows.code) = wv) then raise exception '% 는 이미 BOM 에 쓰이는 코드입니다 — 그 자재를 쓰려면 코드 칸 [🔍 기존 코드 찾기]로 고르세요.', wv; end if;\n        seenW := seenW || jsonb_build_object(wv, 1);\n        if st = 'unused' then unmark := unmark || to_jsonb(wv); end if;\n        if U is null then U := rb_bom_used(conf); end if;\n        U := U || jsonb_build_object(wv, 1);\n        ncode := wv; ver := coalesce(substring(wv from '(\\d+)$')::numeric, 1);\n      else\n        if U is null then U := rb_bom_used(conf); end if;\n        base := left(P, 1) || case when rb_t(c->'type') = '반제품' then 'X' || substr(regexp_replace(P, '^[A-Z]X?', ''), 1, 4) || coalesce((regexp_match(P, '^[A-Z]X?\\d{4}([A-Z]{2})'))[1], 'AA')\n                                   else 'P' || substr(regexp_replace(P, '^[A-Z]X?', ''), 1, 4) || tcode end;\n        select coalesce(max(substr(kk, length(base) + 1)::numeric), 0) + 1 into ver from jsonb_object_keys(U) kk where left(kk, length(base)) = base and substr(kk, length(base) + 1) ~ '^\\d+$';\n        ncode := base || ver::text; U := U || jsonb_build_object(ncode, 1);\n      end if;\n      pn := pn + 1; pid := batch || '-' || pn;\n      rgS := case when c ? 's' and jsonb_typeof(c->'s') <> 'null' and rb_t(c->'s') <> '' then rb_bom_rint(c->'s') else N end;\n      rgE := case when c ? 'e' and jsonb_typeof(c->'e') <> 'null' and rb_t(c->'e') <> '' then rb_bom_rint(c->'e') else 0 end;\n      -- 새 줄: 그 품목 마지막 줄을 본뜬다(값 · 수식) — 머리글에 없는 칸은 비움\n      if isNew then nr := lastRow + jsonb_array_length(adds) - coalesce(array_length(addedIds, 1), 0); else maxSr := maxSr + 1; nr := maxSr; end if;\n      maxB := maxB + 1; newId := 'B' || lpad(maxB::text, 6, '0');\n      x := (W->tmplId->'r') || jsonb_build_object('id', newId, 'sheet_row', nr);\n      foreach k in array rb_bom_keys() loop if rb_bom_hidx(head, k) is null and k <> 'product' then x := jsonb_set(x, array[rb_bom_c(k)], 'null'::jsonb); end if; end loop;\n      ch_ := jsonb_build_object('r', x, 'f', coalesce(W->tmplId->'f', '{}'::jsonb));\n      foreach k in array array['firstAt','common','place','remark','oldCode','change','semi','ord'] loop ch_ := rb_bom_w(ch_, k, to_jsonb(''::text), head); end loop;\n      ch_ := rb_bom_w(ch_, 'id', to_jsonb(newId), head);\n      if isNew then\n        ch_ := rb_bom_w(ch_, 'seq', to_jsonb(''::text), head); ch_ := rb_bom_w(ch_, 'brand', to_jsonb(brand), head);\n        ch_ := rb_bom_w(ch_, 'product', to_jsonb(P), head); ch_ := rb_bom_w(ch_, 'search', to_jsonb(prodName), head);\n      end if;\n      if rb_bom_truthy(c->'reuse') and not isProd then ch_ := rb_bom_w(ch_, 'common', to_jsonb('공용'::text), head); end if;\n      ch_ := rb_bom_w(ch_, 'start', to_jsonb(rgS || '차'), head);\n      ch_ := rb_bom_w(ch_, 'end', to_jsonb(case when rgE <> 0 then rgE || '차' else '' end), head);\n      ch_ := rb_bom_w(ch_, 'code', to_jsonb(ncode), head);\n      ch_ := rb_bom_w(ch_, 'type', to_jsonb(rb_t(c->'type')), head);\n      foreach k in array EDIT loop\n        ch_ := rb_bom_w(ch_, k, case when k = 'cur' then to_jsonb(rb_bom_cur(rb_t(c->k))) when rb_bom_isnum(k) then case when rb_t(c->k) = '' then to_jsonb(''::text) else to_jsonb(rb_num(c->k)) end else to_jsonb(rb_t(c->k)) end, head);\n      end loop;\n      if rb_t(c->'name') = '' then ch_ := rb_bom_w(ch_, 'name', to_jsonb(case when isProd then prodName else prodName || ' ' || rb_t(c->'type') end), head); end if;\n      if rb_num(c->'qty') = 0 then ch_ := rb_bom_w(ch_, 'qty', to_jsonb(1), head); end if;\n      cu1 := coalesce(nullif(rb_bom_cur(rb_t(c->'cur')), ''), '원화');\n      if cu1 = '원화' then fxv := 1;\n      elsif rb_num(c->'fx') <> 0 then fxv := rb_num(c->'fx');\n      elsif rb_num(conf->'fx'->(case cu1 when '달러' then 'USD' else 'CNY' end)) <> 0 then fxv := rb_num(conf->'fx'->(case cu1 when '달러' then 'USD' else 'CNY' end));\n      else raise exception 'RB_FALLBACK 설정 환율 모름'; end if;\n      ch_ := rb_bom_w(ch_, 'cur', to_jsonb(cu1), head);\n      ch_ := rb_bom_w(ch_, 'fx', to_jsonb(fxv), head);\n      ch_ := rb_bom_w(ch_, 'costKey', to_jsonb(case when c->'ck' = 'false'::jsonb then '' else P end), head);\n      ch_ := rb_bom_w(ch_, 'change', to_jsonb(N || '차 ' || case when isNew then '신제품 ' else '자재 추가 ' end || ncode || case when why <> '' then ' (' || why || ')' else '' end || ' · ' || stamp), head);\n      -- bomFixCost_(새 줄): 소요원가가 이 줄 단가를 보는 수식이면 그대로(아래에서 계산), 아니면 값 = calc\n      ch_ := rb_bom_fixcost(ch_, null, head);\n      W := W || jsonb_build_object(newId, ch_);\n      ins := ins || jsonb_build_object(newId, tmplId); touched := touched || newId;\n      addedIds := addedIds || newId;\n      if isComp or rb_bom_truthy(c->'reuse') then null;          -- 가져온 기존 코드 · 세트 구성 완제품은 새 코드 아님\n      elsif isProd then\n        regs := regs || jsonb_build_array(jsonb_build_object('brand', brand, 'kind', case when P ~ '^[A-Z]X' then '반제품' else '제품' end, 'num', substr(regexp_replace(P, '^[A-Z]X?', ''), 1, 4), 'prodName', prodName, 'type', '', 'tcode', '',\n          'v